<section class='home-questions' aria-labelledby='home-questions-title'>
  <div class='container home-questions__container'>
    <div class='home-questions__heading'>
      <h2 id='home-questions-title' class='home-questions__title'>Остались вопросы?</h2>
      <p id='home-questions-description' class='home-questions__description'>
        Оставьте контактные данные, и специалист завода свяжется с вами.
      </p>
    </div>
    <svg
      class='home-questions__icon'
      width='64'
      height='64'
      viewBox='0 0 28 28'
      fill='none'
      aria-hidden='true'
      focusable='false'
    >
      <path d='M6 6L22 22M9 22H22V9' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <button
    class='home-questions__button'
    type='button'
    aria-labelledby='home-questions-title'
    aria-describedby='home-questions-description'
    aria-controls='callback-dialog'
    aria-haspopup='dialog'
    data-callback-open
  ></button>
</section>
